  i1e = `Gyro Pitch Neutral Angle`,
  a1e = `This is the default position for a Centered joystick.  By changing this setting you can alter the neutral centered position to tilt forward or backward which is comfortable to your playing position.  Note that for uses like a steering wheel, it is recommended to disable the vertical portion entirely and just use the Horizontal Axis, where this angle will not come into play.`,
