  Jtt = `Vertical Friction Scale`,
  Ytt = `Vertical Friction determines how fast the vertical movement comes to a stop relative to horizontal movement.  At 50% along the slider it is equal, if less than half it will slow less quickly, if more, more quickly.  For games were you control the camera, it is usually desirable to have high vertical friction so flicks are primarily used for spinning the camera along the horizontal axis.`,
