  Hft = `Style of Input - Mouse Region`,
  Uft = `This input will act as a Mouse Region.  Mouse Region sends mouse input to a game, but treats the pad as a 1:1 map to screen space, so touching a particular place on the pad will always put the cursor in the same place on the screen.  In addition to working great for top-down style games, regions can be restricted to certain areas of the screen, scaled, stretched and mode-shifted in to select mini-maps, toolbars, inventory, etc.`,
