  ypt = `Flip inputs to the region vertically.`,
  bpt = `Touch`,
  xpt = `A command sent while touching the pad.  Commands are 'held down' until you stop touching, which is useful for moving your player.`,
  Spt = `Style of Input - Radial Menu`,
  Cpt = `This input will act as a Radial Menu.  Radial Menus display on-screen when your finger touches the Touch Pad.  Clicking on one of the shown buttons will fire off the appropriate command.  RadialMenus can have a variety of buttons, layouts, size, opacity, and can use icons.`,
