  kpt = `Radial Menu Button Type`,
  Apt = `The interaction with the radial menu can work in a few different ways.  Click commands require the pad or stick to be clicked to use.  If set to touch release/modeshift end, the command will be sent when it stops receiving input or if it's on a modeshift, when that modeshift ends.  "Always" will always send the button so long as the option is highlighted.`,
